{"ref":"BDB, צִֽקְלַג","hw":"צִֽקְלַג","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צִֽקְלַג</span></big>  and (<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.1\">1 Ch 12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.21\">21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיק׳</span>) <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> (<span dir=\"rtl\">צִֽקְלָ֑ג</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 27:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.27.6\">1 S 27:6</a> a +, <span dir=\"rtl\">צִֽקְלָג֖</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.1\">2 S 2:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיקְלָ֔ג</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.1\">1 Ch 12:1</a>);—assigned to Judah <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:31\" href=\"/Joshua.15.31\">Jos 15:31</a>, to Simeon <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:5\" href=\"/Joshua.19.5\">19:5</a>; Philistine city given to David <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 27:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.27.6\">1 S 27:6</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.1\">30:1</a><sup>(×3)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 1:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.1.1\">2 S 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.10\">4:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.30\">1 Ch 4:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.1\">12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.21\">21</a> (van d. H. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.20\">20</a>); Σεκελακ, Σικελαγ, etc.; usually identified with <em>Zuheilikah</em>, 19 miles SW. from <em>Bêt</em> Jibrin, 11 miles ESE. from Gaza (cf. Buhl<sup>Geogr. 185</sup>).","next":"BDB, צִקָּלֹן","prev":"BDB, צָקוּן"}